hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"846","Abu Hurayra said"
"847","See hadith 837."
"848","Usama ibn Zayd reported that the Messenger of Allah"
"849","Anas said"
"850","'Abdullah gave 'Alqama the kunya Abu Shibl when he had no children."
"851","'Alqama said"
"852","'A'isha said"
"853","'A'isha said"
"854","Sahl ibn Sa'd related that the name which 'Ali"
"855","Anas said"
"856","Qays said"
"857","Musa ibn 'Ali reported from his father that 'Amr ibn al-'As said"
"858","Khalid ibn Kaysan said"
"859","Mutarrif said"
